    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In a glorious past, the kingdom of Meritons shone with wisdom and prosperity. But after centuries, the whole dynasty's been falling apart. The governance of the kingdom has crumbled, injustices have multiplied, and many citizens have been forced to leave a system that has become unfair and outdated.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320630/extras/07e31e2fb8f4d2a981aa9625a56489ac.poster.avif?t=1751636750\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320630/extras/07e31e2fb8f4d2a981aa9625a56489ac.webm?t=1751636750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320630/extras/07e31e2fb8f4d2a981aa9625a56489ac.mp4?t=1751636750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You joined a small group in a camp near the city.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To survive, we\u2019ll have to help each other and stick to the camp rules. Food, water, electricity, cleaning, resource management and rat hunting. Everything counts!</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320630/extras/56ac80fa609ba9408ddb3c352756d885.poster.avif?t=1751636750\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320630/extras/56ac80fa609ba9408ddb3c352756d885.webm?t=1751636750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320630/extras/56ac80fa609ba9408ddb3c352756d885.mp4?t=1751636750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>The camp\u2019s really basic, we\u2019ll need to upgrade it if we want to survive the winters. You\u2019ll help explore and discover new tools and techniques to craft improvements.\u00a0From shelter insulation to vegetable gardening to electrical systems, there's plenty to do!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320630/extras/68f17e5d6a01edfad1be0e2e5aa2e861.avif?t=1751636750\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outcasts, but not alone! You\u2019ll have plenty of missions to gain experience. Team up with your campmates for the riskiest tasks. High risk, high reward.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320630/extras/7f6e37b653e8fcb6809699b980fe665c.avif?t=1751636750\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resources are running low, and the competition outside the camp is brutal. Don\u2019t let anyone push you around. You're going to have to fight!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320630/extras/c2150585bdb574b72a8e10b010d80ef0.avif?t=1751636750\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
